--- !u!114 &2122104360
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2122104357}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3b400c73cae759141952f2d3a4056940, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StepAudioPlayer
  audioSource: {fileID: 2122104359}
  subtitleText: {fileID: 1140657474}
  continueButton: {fileID: 1692097562}
  subtitles:
  - text: "G\xFCne\u015F tutulmas\u0131 incelemesine D\xFCnya\u2019dan bakarak ba\u015Fl\u0131yoruz."
    startTime: 0
    endTime: 3
  - text: "\u015Eu anda g\xF6zlem noktam\u0131z D\xFCnya \xFCzerinde. "
    startTime: 3
    endTime: 6
  - text: "Normal durumda G\xFCne\u015F g\xF6ky\xFCz\xFCnde parlak bir \u015Fekilde
      g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr. "
    startTime: 5
    endTime: 10
  - text: "Ancak Ay, y\xF6r\xFCngesi \xFCzerinde hareket ederken "
    startTime: 10
    endTime: 13
  - text: "G\xFCne\u015F ile D\xFCnya aras\u0131na girdi\u011Finde G\xFCne\u015F\u2019in
      \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 engellemeye ba\u015Flar."
    startTime: 13
    endTime: 17
  - text: "Ay, G\xFCne\u015F\u2019in \xF6n\xFCne do\u011Fru ilerledik\xE7e G\xFCne\u015F\u2019in
      bir b\xF6l\xFCm\xFC kapan\u0131r."
    startTime: 18
    endTime: 21
  - text: "Bu durum par\xE7al\u0131 G\xFCne\u015F tutulmas\u0131 olarak g\xF6zlemlenir. "
    startTime: 21
    endTime: 25
  - text: "Ay, G\xFCne\u015F\u2019in merkezini tamamen kapatt\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
      ise tam G\xFCne\u015F tutulmas\u0131 meydana gelir. "
    startTime: 25
    endTime: 31
  - text: "Bu anda D\xFCnya \xFCzerindeki baz\u0131 b\xF6lgelerde \u0131\u015F\u0131k
      azal\u0131r "
    startTime: 31
    endTime: 34
  - text: "ve k\u0131sa s\xFCreli karanl\u0131k bir g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm olu\u015Fur."
    startTime: 34
    endTime: 37
